 "remarks": "PRICE DROP TO $2,700-THE ULTIMATE ALL-INCLUSIVE VALUE IN NORWALK! Avoid the hidden monthly fees typical of corporate apartment complexes. While other buildings charge a base rent and tack on expensive monthly add-ons, this beautifully updated 2BR/1BA first-floor apartment provides significant, transparent savings built directly into the rent. COMPARE THE VALUE (ALL INCLUDED AT NO EXTRA CHARGE): * HEAT INCLUDED (Save $150-$250+/mo in winter) * 2 PRIVATE OFF-STREET PARKING SPACES INCLUDED (Other buildings charge $75-$150/mo per car) * PRIVATE BASEMENT STORAGE LOCKER INCLUDED (Other buildings charge $50-$100/mo) * COLD WATER, SEWER & TRASH INCLUDED (Save $40-$60/mo) * Total estimated savings: $300 to $500+ saved every single month compared to competing rentals! MAXIMUM LAYOUT FLEXIBILITY: The apartment features a spacious primary bedroom and a versatile 12x7 second bedroom. This highly functional layout is perfect for an efficient home office, a nursery, a creative studio, or a cozy second bedroom using a twin bed or daybed setup. PREMIUM REMODEL: Be the very first to live in this top-to-bottom renovation. Features a gorgeous chef's kitchen with premium stone countertops, custom cabinetry, a deep sink, and stainless steel appliances (gas range, refrigerator, microwave). The pristine bath features a new modern vanity and designer lighting. Enjoy sleek modern flooring, fresh paint, and bright LED lighting throughout.",
